---
const steps = [
  ['1', '初始球对称密度 n⁽⁰⁾(r)', 'Initial spherical density'],
  ['2', '构造 Vext + VH + Vxc', 'Build the effective potential'],
  ['3', '逐 l 通道求解径向方程', 'Solve radial equations by l channel'],
  ['4', '按指定占据重构 nout(r)', 'Rebuild density with declared occupations'],
  ['5', '计算残差并 mixing', 'Evaluate residual and mix'],
  ['6', '独立检查能量与目标量', 'Check energy and target observables separately'],
];
---

<figure class="chapter-visual atomic-scf-flow">
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创流程图：球对称原子 SCF | Original flow diagram: spherical atomic SCF</strong>
    <span>图示算法依赖关系，不指定某个程序的 mixing 实现或收敛阈值。</span>
    <span lang="en">The diagram shows algorithmic dependencies and does not prescribe a code-specific mixing method or convergence threshold.</span>
  </figcaption>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 820 430" role="img" aria-labelledby="atomic-scf-title atomic-scf-desc">
    <title id="atomic-scf-title">Self-consistent radial atomic calculation</title>
    <desc id="atomic-scf-desc">Six steps form a loop from an input density through an effective potential and radial solve to a mixed density, followed by separate observable checks.</desc>
    {steps.map(([number, zh, en], index) => {
      const column = index % 2;
      const row = Math.floor(index / 2);
      const x = 35 + column * 405;
      const y = 30 + row * 125;
      return (
        <g>
          <rect x={x} y={y} width="350" height="82" rx="10" />
          <circle cx={x + 30} cy={y + 28} r="17" />
          <text class="step-number" x={x + 30} y={y + 33} text-anchor="middle">{number}</text>
          <text x={x + 58} y={y + 28}>{zh}</text>
          <text class="step-en" x={x + 58} y={y + 52}>{en}</text>
        </g>
      );
    })}
    <path d="M385 71 H430" />
    <path d="M615 112 V145 H210 V155" />
    <path d="M385 196 H430" />
    <path d="M615 237 V270 H210 V280" />
    <path d="M385 321 H430" />
    <path class="loop" d="M615 362 V402 H18 V71 H35" />
    <text class="loop-label" x="25" y="390">未收敛 | not converged</text>
    <text class="exit-label" x="620" y="395">收敛后继续性质检查 | continue after convergence</text>
  </svg>

  <ol class="atomic-scf-flow__fallback">
    {steps.map(([number, zh, en]) => (
      <li><strong>{number}. {zh}</strong><span lang="en">{en}</span></li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>流程必须包含一个由输出密度返回输入密度的显式残差回路；总能或目标 observable 的检查位于密度收敛之外，不能被“SCF 已结束”替代。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the flow must include an explicit residual loop from the output density back to the input density; total-energy and target-observable checks remain separate from density convergence.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>真实原子程序还需要本征值搜索、节点计数、占据稳定性、相对论选项和径向网格收敛。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> a real atomic code additionally requires eigenvalue search, node counting, occupation stability, relativistic choices, and radial-grid convergence.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .atomic-scf-flow svg {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 20rem;
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow rect {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow circle {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow .step-number {
    fill: var(--sl-color-black);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow .step-en {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke-width: 2.2;
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow .loop {
    stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow .loop-label,
  .atomic-scf-flow .exit-label {
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .atomic-scf-flow__fallback {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .atomic-scf-flow svg {
      display: none;
    }

    .atomic-scf-flow__fallback {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }

    .atomic-scf-flow__fallback li {
      display: grid;
    }
  }
</style>
